# The Kafka client of the event-bus relay (ADR 0006 slice 1, plan task S1.10, D9). Optional: smo/Dockerfile installs it only with
# --build-arg WITH_KAFKA=1 (docker compose: SMO_WITH_KAFKA=1), and nothing imports it unless SMO_KAFKA_RELAY is on (smo_shared/kafka_relay.py).
# confluent-kafka's base install has no Python dependency (librdkafka and OpenSSL are bundled in its wheel; ADR 0006 section 3.4, Q4).
# Not part of dev.txt: the unit tests use a fake producer, the compose job "Kafka profile round trip" the real client. Recompile: see README.
